  },
  {
    title: 'Is a PSU job actually the safer choice, or is private-sector growth worth the extra risk?',
    body: "Both are genuine paths with different trade-offs. A PSU role offers real security and a stable income floor; private-sector growth at a company like Alembic, or elsewhere, can offer a faster-moving income ceiling at a different risk level. The right answer depends on your specific financial runway, risk appetite, and skill direction, not a blanket rule.",
  },
  {
    title: 'I am studying engineering at MSU mainly because it was the assumed path - is it too late to reconsider?',
    body: "No. A degree already in progress does not lock in one specific career ladder. The more useful question is what skill-first direction you build on top of that degree, whether that means leaning further into the PSU-and-technical track or building toward something genuinely different.",
  },
];

const buyerCheckItems = [
  {
    title: "Check whether the counsellor understands Vadodara's PSU-and-heavy-industry culture, not just generic family-business succession",
    body: "Vadodara's defining pressure is not a family trade or a b-school bar - it is a PSU-and-heavy-engineering-and-chemicals default. Good guidance should be able to speak credibly to whether a refinery, GSFC, or GACL-track role, or a genuinely different path, actually fits your situation.",
  },
  {
    title: "Check whether MSU's fine-arts and humanities path is taken as seriously as the engineering-and-PSU track",
    body: "Because the PSU default is so visible in Vadodara, some guidance can unintentionally treat a fine-arts or humanities calling as a lesser option by default. Better guidance should name that pressure directly and take a genuine MSU fine-arts path as seriously as an engineering one.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Check whether PSU security and private-sector growth are both weighed honestly',
    body: "Vadodara's real economy spans large PSU employers and a genuine private pharma-and-chemicals sector through Alembic and the Gorwa-Makarpura-Nandesari belt. Guidance that only speaks to one of these, or assumes PSU is always safer, is missing the actual local picture.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Check whether the next move respects your specific risk appetite and family context',
    body: "Good guidance for Vadodara should be realistic about family expectation, PSU-versus-private trade-offs, and the actual skill gaps involved in each option - not push a single default answer regardless of your situation.",
  },
];

const relatedItems = [
  {
    href: BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations,
    title: 'Career Guidance by Location',
    description: 'See other city guidance options if you want to compare before deciding further.',
  },
  {
    href: BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.ahmedabadCounselling,
    title: 'Career Counselling in Ahmedabad',
    description: 'See this if your bigger question is a family-business-succession or GIFT City finance decision rather than a PSU-versus-fine-arts fork.',
  },
  {
    href: BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.suratCounselling,
