  },
  {
    href: BOFU_ASSESSMENT_LINKS.hub,
    title: 'Free Career Assessments',
    description: 'Free career and skill assessments can be a lower-pressure check if you are not ready for stronger guidance yet.',
  },
];

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'Why choose online career counselling in Vadodara instead of only looking for a nearby offline office?',
    answer:
      "Because proximity alone does not resolve Vadodara's real fork - PSU or heavy-engineering-and-chemicals stability versus an MSU fine-arts or humanities calling, or PSU security versus private-sector growth. Online guidance lets you start from home, an MSU-affiliated campus, or a GIDC-linked workplace without waiting for local availability, and it should still be judged on whether it understands that specific decision.",
  },
  {
    question: 'My family wants me on a PSU track at the refinery or GSFC. Is it reasonable to consider MSU\'s fine-arts path instead?',
    answer:
      "Yes. A PSU role is a genuine, respectable option for the right person, but so is a credentialed fine-arts or humanities path through MSU's Faculty of Fine Arts - one of India's most respected institutions of its kind. The honest approach compares both against your actual strengths and interest, not against which one your family has always assumed.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Is a PSU job at Gujarat Refinery, GSFC, or GACL actually the safer choice compared to a private-sector role?',
    answer:
      "A PSU role offers genuine job security and a stable income floor, while private-sector roles - at Alembic Pharmaceuticals, other Gorwa-Makarpura-Nandesari-belt firms, or elsewhere - can offer a faster-moving income ceiling with a different risk profile. Neither is automatically better; the right choice depends on your specific risk appetite, financial runway, and skill direction.",
  },
  {
    question: 'What career paths actually make sense for someone in Vadodara?',
    answer:
      "It depends on the person, not only the city. Vadodara has genuine opportunity across its PSU and heavy-chemical-engineering base (Gujarat Refinery, GSFC, GACL), a real private pharma and chemicals sector led by Alembic Pharmaceuticals, and a genuinely respected fine-arts and humanities track through MSU - alongside its broader technology, medicine, and commerce faculties. The right direction is the one that fits your strengths and has real income-growth potential, not just the one that was always assumed.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Are the career and skill assessments free?',
    answer: 'Yes. The career and skill assessments are fully free, updated, practical, and AI-powered.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can this help students, freshers, and working professionals in Vadodara?',
    answer:
      'Yes. Future Career School serves students, freshers, and working professionals across school, college, recent-graduate, postgraduate, and career-growth stages. The guidance is online across India, so there are no local-access limits for Vadodara users.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What if I am from Vadodara but the bigger issue is not the city, the PSU track, or fine arts at all?',
    answer:
      "That is common. The city search is often a trust shortcut. If the real pressure is stream selection, degree choice, skill direction, or a career change unrelated to the PSU-versus-fine-arts fork, the main counselling and guidance pages are the stronger next filter. This page is most useful when Vadodara's specific PSU, heavy-industry, or MSU fine-arts context is genuinely part of your decision.",
  },
];

const faqJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqItems.map((item) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: item.question,
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: item.answer,
    },
  })),
};

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://futurecareerschool.com/' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Services', item: 'https://futurecareerschool.com/services/' },
