---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Vadodara</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Vadodara
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career counselling in Vadodara
        <span class="gold-text"> for PSU, chemicals, and fine-arts decisions</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Vadodara raises a career fork few other cities force this directly: whether to build toward a PSU or heavy-engineering-and-chemicals
        role at an employer like Gujarat Refinery, GSFC, or GACL, or toward a genuinely respected fine-arts or humanities calling through
        MSU's Faculty of Fine Arts - and, underneath that, whether PSU job security or private-sector growth actually fits your situation
        better. Getting clear on the real trade-offs, and building the kind of high-value skill portfolio that unlocks high income
        opportunities, matters more than defaulting to whichever option was never really questioned.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is delivered fully online in Vadodara and across India. You can start from home, an MSU campus, or work, wherever you
        already are - no travel, no waiting for local availability.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        The stronger filter is not only whether the search started with Vadodara. It is whether the guidance understands the specific fork
        your decision actually sits inside - PSU stability, private-sector growth, engineering, or a genuine fine-arts calling.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="psu-vs-arts"
    title="The PSU-and-chemicals default versus MSU's fine-arts calling - the fork Vadodara rarely names out loud"
    subtitle="This is the single most defining career fork in the city, and it has no equivalent framing on any other city page: a genuine choice between a well-established technical track and a genuinely respected creative one."
    items={psuVsArtsItems}
    variant="contrast"
  />

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="If the PSU-versus-fine-arts fork, or the PSU-versus-private-growth question, already feels real, move before the default hardens"
